# ============================================================
# .gitignore 示例（供参考，非强制）
#
# 用法：如需启用，复制成 .gitignore 即可，再按你的项目情况增删：
#     cp .gitignore.example .gitignore
#
# 主要用来忽略编译产物，避免把它们误提交到参赛仓。
# 其他类型（编辑器临时文件、缓存、本地密钥等）可按需自行添加。
#
# 注意：logs/ 下最终导出的 AI Coding 日志必须提交，不要忽略！
# ============================================================

# Build artifacts
build/
out/
*.o
*.a
*.elf
*.hex
*.map
.depend
*.dep
BTdocs/
notes/
music.mp3
music.flac

# Desktop simulation test binaries for the BK7258 camera driver stack
# (board/beken/chips/bk7258/sim_tests/ and
# board/beken/boards/bk7258/bk7258-ap/src/sim_tests_gc2145/): both test
# suites' Makefiles emit their compiled test binaries and object files
# under a build/ subdirectory, already covered by the "build/" rule
# above -- this comment exists only to make that coverage explicit for
# future maintainers, since these are native x86 test binaries (not
# ARM/NuttX build artifacts) and it is not obvious from the "build/"
# rule alone that they are intentionally covered rather than
# accidentally matched.

# Vendor confidential documents (not for open-source distribution)
*Datasheet*.pdf

docs/superpowers/
docs/README
board/beken/chips/bk7258/sim_tests